# MorningTV Environment Configuration Example
# MorningTV runs locally out-of-the-box without requiring mandatory environment variables for development.

# Optional CI/CD Release Signing Secrets:
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN TAURI PRIVATE KEY...-----"
# TAURI_SIGNING_KEY_PASSWORD=""

# Optional Custom Proxy Configuration:
# MORNINGTV_PORT=18181
